{"unit_id":"taichuy__deepseek-harness-auth#card-zh","repo":"taichuy/deepseek-harness-auth","commit":"ac44b1081de6603dbfb6628a9df61f798d9e644d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-harness-auth 是适用于 DSH Web profile 的账号密码认证代理插件。它将 Harness WebServer 绑定到本机回环地址，并通过公共代理处理登录与已认证请求。功能包括交互式账号初始化、浏览器会话、IP/CIDR 白名单、登录验证码策略和账号安全设置页面。适合需要为 Web profile 增加本机账号门禁与远程浏览器管理的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:15-18","src/proxy.ts:322-354","src/cli.ts:108-143","src/client/index.tsx:150-210"]}
